{"4570020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FOURSAVENT", "steam_appid": 4570020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/fb201215def057f9123c91e8182d27bc.avif?t=1786741060\" width=1536 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>FOURSAVENT</u> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>is a horror game where a new map releases every month, featuring a new universe and story to discover. Experience each cinematic story alone or with up to FOUR friends—or enter Chaos Mode with up to 6 players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>CHAOS MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> features five sections with high octane fast paced interchangeable levels, making every playthrough unique and extreme. Experience new maps each time, with over a thousand possible gameplay combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>UGC Level Builder</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create, build, and play through user-created worlds. Design your own maps, stories, challenges, and unique gameplay experiences—then share them for others to discover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/24115b7205e7577150e9f44454293e72.poster.avif?t=1786741060\" width=800 height=940 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/24115b7205e7577150e9f44454293e72.webm?t=1786741060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/24115b7205e7577150e9f44454293e72.mp4?t=1786741060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The game will come with two Gamemodes, one that is story based and another that is for pure chaotic fun.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/db837d5977c052a687012a626344e7b9.poster.avif?t=1786741060\" width=850 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/db837d5977c052a687012a626344e7b9.webm?t=1786741060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/db837d5977c052a687012a626344e7b9.mp4?t=1786741060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>CHAOS MODE (In early development stage, see below what it will become)</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/202862e0dc03dc32136a093d2ee37783.poster.avif?t=1786741060\" width=800 height=1128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/202862e0dc03dc32136a093d2ee37783.webm?t=1786741060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4570020/extras/202862e0dc03dc32136a093d2ee37783.mp4?t=1786741060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\